# Whitelist mode: ignore everything, then explicitly allow the files we ship.
# To track a new file, add a matching "!name" line below.
*

!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!index.html
!universal_scoreboard_pwa.html
!sw.js
!manifest.webmanifest
!icon-180.png
!icon-192.png
!icon-512.png
!build.sh
!test.js
!.github/
!.github/**
